  "description": {
    "en": "A festive launch across print and digital.\n\nYolo Navidad was a limited-edition holiday flavor from Yolo, the Venezuelan Greek yogurt brand known for its playful identity. I developed the full visual campaign for its release, across print, digital and in-store, each piece built to feel like celebration and warmth while staying unmistakably Yolo.\n\nA full-page ad for Avior's in-flight magazine; billboards with bold type and high-impact imagery; catalogue pages and inserts; red-and-gold key visuals with Christmas-tree graphics; Instagram stories ('Celebra, tú decides cómo', '¡Pruébalo ya!'); and supermarket danglers to win the shelf.\n\nTimeframe: 10 days · Tools: Illustrator, Photoshop, Figma"
  },
